# Map tiles.
#
# Leave everything unset to use OpenStreetMap, which needs no key and is fine
# for development. For production, sign up with a tile provider and fill these
# in inside a .env.local file (git-ignored) — never commit a real key.
#
# MapTiler example:
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/streets-v2/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key={key}
# VITE_MAP_API_KEY=your_key_here
# VITE_MAP_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; MapTiler &copy; OpenStreetMap contributors
# VITE_MAP_MAX_ZOOM=20
